Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:04.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是谁 - 利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell! - Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the hell away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的世界由我主宰 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world is whatever I want it to be, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道真相吗 你出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know the truth? You got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把你弄出来了 小萨姆 这是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you out, Sammy. This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得去见一个名叫弗兰克·德弗罗的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to see a fella named Frank Devereaux.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲍比·辛格派我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby singer sent us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对我们造不成威胁 我们有不死之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop any of us. We can't be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家伙比你们狡猾多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things are smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本不知道怎么杀它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a clue how to kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是拖延时间 而你们的计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or slow 'em down, and your plan is, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正面交锋吗 - 孩儿们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go right at 'em? - Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年追杀你的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years of demons nipping at your heels,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:00:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,却已经几个月没见到了 想知道原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}haven't seen one for months. Wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:00:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙着猎杀利维坦 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting Leviathan … yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们见过那个迪克（混蛋）了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You met that dick yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应当成为朋友 我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be friends, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.66,0:01:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会跟你合作 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never work with you, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 狗娘养的 看看你们到底想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you sons of bitches. Let's see what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.53,0:01:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧呼叫待命的神经外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page the neurosurgeon on call.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会死 只是一枚子弹而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna die. It's one bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事 因为他向来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be fine because he's always fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我不是真实存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe I'm not real,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.63,0:01:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我哪里也不去 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not going anywhere, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.39,0:01:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睁眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eyes are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:38.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.89,0:01:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经连续在这儿待了好几晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been here a couple nights in a row now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让我喜欢这里的氛围呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say? I like the ambience.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要点别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 路上注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Keep safe out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 迷路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there. You lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去有点精神恍惚哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking a little cabo wabo, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忙着欣赏窗外小妞的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slipped a little special sauce into your coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你的咖啡里加了点儿特殊作料\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you were watching the skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:02:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们能分泌毒液吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know we're venomous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来给你下药的剂量还不够足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I didn't dose you quite hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液要多少有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小费给那么少 给你点儿教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for the crappy tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:28.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第一周）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:06.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第二周）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:29.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邮政编码）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:36.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第三周）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（比格森餐厅召回被污染肉类 顾客食用火鸡鸭三明治后染病）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.81,0:05:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 我们是不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I wonder if … if we…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该向大家公布这个消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, should we be telling people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指认识他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, people he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那组数字给弗兰克多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long ago did I give Frank these numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几周了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a few weeks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是解不出来 还是懒得联系咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, is he nuts, or is he just being rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概两者都有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably both.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我得问你个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I-I got to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他遭遇了不测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, something happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸被利维坦咬掉了 所以没法打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't get to the phone because a Leviathan ate his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有这种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, also a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go check on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你到底想不想打电话通知鲍比的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, do you want to call Bobby's people or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要我们来通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-why is that our job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然还有谁来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because who else is gonna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想给任何人打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not calling anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想打 自己打去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to, you go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想打电话 开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to call anybody. You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比·辛格在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Bobby Singer there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在 他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. He's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是…我是他朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-it's not, but I'm a friend of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸特别交代要我找鲍比·辛格本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Dad asked me to call Bobby Singer specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在 但如果你需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…not here, but, look, if you need s…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,找鲍比吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖饼干的女童子军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl scout cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是个猎人的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a-a hunter's kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她听上去很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she sounded pretty scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有来电号码 我们该去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I have a caller I.D. Maybe we should go find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她有没有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can check on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那弗兰克怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我觉得我们应该先去找这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean, I think we should go find this girl first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 弗兰克正在破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Frank's been working on the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比用最后一口气写下的数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Bobby spent his last breath on,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你也要往后推吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to back-burner that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你去找那个女童子军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. You go check out girl scout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:06:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但我有个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. But you know what? On one condition …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你发现弗兰克还活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Frank is just spinning his wheels,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就撇下那个疯子 赶紧来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you bail out on crazy and come meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的啤酒喝光了 十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks for drinking my entire beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没碰你的啤酒 我的在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't touch your beer. Mine's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,八成是你不知不觉喝光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably drank it without noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前通过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we…spoke on the phone earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:07:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…I'm sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在电话里听上去需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sounded like you needed help,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比的通讯簿里有你爸的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad is in Bobby's address book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, um …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克里希 - 克里希\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Krissy. - Krissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 不能让陌生人进门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. You don't let strangers in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过如果你爸爸说可以相信鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if your dad said you could trust Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you can trust me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清楚 911设了快捷拨号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, 911's on speed-dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一键搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}One button.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 记住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. Note taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是推销员\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're a salesman, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸还在外面没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your dad's on the road right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一阵子了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been gone a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前每晚都会打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He usually calls every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久没联系你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.88,0:08:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,五天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里只有你和他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just you and him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干我们这一行 总有个马高蹬短\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes on the road, crap happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll help you track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - 'course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有说他去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he happen to say where he was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说在道奇城附近有几个客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he had a couple leads near Dodge City.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有书桌什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And does he have a desk or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,存放他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he keeps his stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我煮杯咖啡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind making some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:14.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（失踪报告 堪萨斯州立警察局）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的 我知道去哪里调查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, so I think I got an idea where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个能借给我用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…can I borrow this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有一个号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a number,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果几天后没有我的消息 就打过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case you don't hear from me in the next couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会打电话来报平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I'll check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样说 我爸爸也是这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that. That's what my dad said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're amongst friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,利维坦肯定也会这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just what a Leviathan would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 我不是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank…I'm not a Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你不是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure. You're not a Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·罗曼不是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Roman's not a Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温妮丝·帕特洛（著名演员）也不是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwyneth Paltrow is not a Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You know what, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:12:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你调查得有点过头了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've been doing a little too much research.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无处不在 千变万化\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're anywhere, anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弗兰克知道的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's to say this ain't the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他们今天会不会来下毒手\N{\fnArial\fs30}they come for old Frank who knew too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的血是黑色胶状物 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bleed black goo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.19,0:12:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要看看我的血是什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to see what I bleed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都别动枪 行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take the guns out of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没 正宗的红血美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Red-blooded American.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 我显然不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Whoa. Look, I'm obviously not …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要讲公平 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair's fair, douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴我们俩一起见红\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad we could share that together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好枪 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your gun, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要弄出什么声响\N{\fnArial\fs30}For god's sake, don't make any noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么缩小规模了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the downsize?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 好好查查理查德·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, Frank, go dig up some dirt on Richard Roman."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上 我所有的IP都用报废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night, I was burned off every I.P. I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话有人监听 房子受到监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ears on my phones, eyes on my house…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 是迪克派人监视你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … Dick's got people watching you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.10,0:13:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为就我这妄想症的程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's easy to see this deep into what's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,去深入挖掘真相容易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and also be bipolar with delusional ideation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的情况无药可救了 小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no pill for my situation, sweetiepop,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以最靠谱的猜测是 大嘴怪冲着我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, yeah, best guess … the bigmouths are onto me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.05,0:13:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 关于大嘴怪有什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, what's the word on the bigmouths?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的触手无所不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their tentacles are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了银行家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm looking at bankers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,军方高层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military high-ups…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你没有回我的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why you didn't call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, cut me some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是四天前给我打的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called me like four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是四个星期以前 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called you four weeks ago, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 乱讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它几天 你就别逼我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Days, weeks … quit busting my chops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你逗我玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我冷静点 娃儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cool your heels, buster brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 我可付了你一万五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, I paid you 15 grand for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 我懂 - 不 你根本不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I get that… - No, you don't get that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.01,0:14:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就只有迪克·罗曼这一张牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Roman is every card in my hit deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些数字肯定跟他有什么关联 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those numbers, they got something to do with him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比就是为此而死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby died for those numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我对鲍比的事感到遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry about Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 那次在夫勒斯诺市\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this one time, we were in Fresno,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们困住了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we got stuck …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不听你这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次我和鲍比怎么怎么的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}"this one time with Bobby" Crap, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不怎么认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna get all warm and fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来跟我搞温情\N{\fnArial\fs30}with somebody else who barely knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想说点友好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to make friendly conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没什么可友好的 我付了钱 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a friendship, Frank. I'm paying you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你知道你需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You know what you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.53,0:14:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点迷幻药\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little LSD,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再做个按摩 - 我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- a little shiatsu… - I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想知道那组数字的含义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to know what those numbers are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bupkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是彩票号码 不是车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not lottery numbers, license …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道 弗兰克 多谢指教\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that, Frank. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来 我们就只能依靠概率了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which leaves us little else to do but probability generate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去查一个要死的酒鬼写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run most reasonable possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟利维坦有关的五位数码\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a Levi-related five-digit number.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是什么意思 却毫无结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}written by a dying drunk, you come up flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你想到了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what you start to wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「说不定少了一个数」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, maybe I'm missing a number."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how you figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为鲍比当时颅脑损伤就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Bobby was dying of brain trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们什么都查不到是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a tickle there's a reason nothing was popping out at us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我编了个程序 匹配可能的六位数码\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I set up a program to run possibilities for six numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有七位和八位\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.66,0:15:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但好消息是 - 有好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But good news. - Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,六位就查到了 因为这些数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had to go past six, because this…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小羊羔 是坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my little lamb, is coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,指向哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯康星洲的一片野地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A field in Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 鲍比才不会给我们一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bobby didn't give us coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,智兹维尔一片杂草地的坐标呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to some patch of weeds in cheeseville.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他给你的坐标指向的地皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he gave you coordinates to a parcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚被威廉公司收购\N{\fnArial\fs30}recently purchased by Willman, Inc.,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这家公司正是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a subsidiary of…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德·罗曼企业旗下的子公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Richard Roman enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 如果我们很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, if we're stupid…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跑过去设立监控设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}we go there and set up surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修·海夫莱纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matthew Havlena …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在州际公路的地沟里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}found in a ditch off the interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,死因是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,失血五品脱肯定是原因之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing five pints of blood can't have helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:16:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有穿刺伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Puncture wounds …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,股动脉和颈动脉都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}femoral arteries and carotid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是动物袭击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Some kind of animal attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人一般至少会笑笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. That…usually gets at least a chuckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到弗兰克了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 那些数字是坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Those numbers? Coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克买了块地 我们正往那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick bought some land. We're headed there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们就那么开车过去…-别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're just gonna drive right up to… - Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片空地而已 又不是闯死星\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a field, not the Death Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克去参加TED大会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick's at a T.E.D. conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:28.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈芬顿邮报》上都写着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over the Huffington Post.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始看报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,知己知彼 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know your enemy, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩的事怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她都不知道她爸爸是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she even knows her Dad's in the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前 有三个卡车司机失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, I got three missing truckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一具血被吸干的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one blood-free body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.19,0:17:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好世道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 有情况告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,设备都弄好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the equipment arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来穿上服装 我们快点动身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get your costume on. We can scoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还「服装」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Costume"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有什么特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's so special abou this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢谜题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快坐吊车台上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get up in that cherry picker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:17:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,装成维修东西的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and act like you're fixing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么用那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to drive that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么我要去干…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why do I got to be the sap that …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件上写着「经理」 这件写着「技工」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one says "manager." That one says "technician."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个月内能上去不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometime this month?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来吧 泰山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down, Tarzan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干什么 - 快下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - Get down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方他们安了一堆摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got this place wired up the wazoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.19,0:19:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在就能看到我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're watching us right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是看到了电话公司的张三李四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, nah, they're just watching Cheech and Ed from Ma Bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 如果这里到处是监控设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's gonna be a little difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还想再安监控设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}to set up surveillance if there's,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是有点难啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, surveillance everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以我们改用切入他们的设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So we need to tap into theirs instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色真差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look horrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次好好睡一觉是什么时候的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you really slept a night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶紧干活 成不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just work, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是干活儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们盯着屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We watch the screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先值第一班岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take the first shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想帮忙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no use if you can't even…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也要睁得开眼才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个人在猎杀一个嗜血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think this guy was hunting a Vetala.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸以前干掉过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad took one down back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,银质刀子刺入心脏 扭一下 就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver knife to the heart, twist, they're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他写到他们大多离群索居\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says they're maladjusted loner types …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢把人打晕 拖回去 慢慢享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}like to knock a guy out, drag him home, feed slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说 如果克里希的爸爸被抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if Krissy's dad got grabbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:19:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或许还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a chance he might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想把这女孩的父亲送回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be nice to get this girl's dad back home to her, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你能帮我就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I could use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们经理说你或许能帮上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your manager said that you might be able to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,前两天可能招待过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…might have served him the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他可能是去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he may have gone to…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,找外边那个女孩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk to that girl out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you for a second, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sally?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这个男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.09,0:21:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们找地方私下聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere private.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不太平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happening around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕下一个会是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'll be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莉 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sally, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long was I out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约36小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}'bout 36 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不叫醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you wake me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是你管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.53,0:22:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是高潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it gets good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.86,0:22:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 别一副宅男样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, you need to get out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.35,0:22:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这位女强人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out Sarah Palin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.71,0:22:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达·威勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda Willer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise, surprise …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.65,0:22:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在理查德·罗曼手下工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}works for Richard Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个娇蛮的小淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a naughty, bossy little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.47,0:22:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我想听不带色情意味的版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate to ask for that in the non-porno version.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.85,0:22:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在做调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're surveying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正准备建个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting ready to build something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要建什么 - 问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Build what? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.31,0:22:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,建什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do we find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.75,0:22:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}We watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点 小蟋蟀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, grasshopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和耐心一向不合拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, patience and me aren't exactly on terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.97,0:22:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就出门大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then go out and kill something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.16,0:22:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者做点你们平时用来消火的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whatever you kids do to blow off steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.55,0:22:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 不喜欢我的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you don't like my suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:23:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你没资格给我建议 成不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're in a position to be giving suggestions, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带个锡纸帽就能进精神病院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're one tinfoil hat away from a rubber room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你你气色很差了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention you look awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为我在乎的一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because somebody I cared about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚被爆头而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}just got shot in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事就是徒劳一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is like shoving a rock up a hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.40,0:23:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And … screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.01,0:23:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不请自说地给你个建议 放弃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my advice you didn't ask for … quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想继续下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.11,0:23:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想迪克·罗曼去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Dick Roman on a spit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这幅德行 肯定先把自己累死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna drive yourself into the ground first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.74,0:23:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.16,0:23:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会抛下我弟弟不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna walk out on my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 那就像我一样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then, fine. Do what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.13,0:23:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 藏头露尾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Go native?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,囤积C型口粮（美国陆军口粮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stock up on C-Rations?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,错 小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.89,0:23:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指的是我26岁那年\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did when I was 26.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家发现我妻子和两个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and came home to find my wife and two kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人开膛破肚之后做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}gutted on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.52,0:23:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,强迫自己到周末的时候就要打起精神来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decide to be fine till the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.78,0:23:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要活着就要保持微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself smile because you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.23,0:23:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:24:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一周继续如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do it again the next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.47,0:24:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要假装若无其事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So fake it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管这叫职业素养\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it being professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么面带微笑 好好干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it right, with a smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.23,0:24:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么直接退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}or don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.06,0:24:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.04,0:24:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个人在猎杀一个嗜血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think this guy was hunting a Vetala.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.61,0:24:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸以前干掉过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad took one down back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.41,0:24:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 萨姆 这可不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Sam, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the guff?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.98,0:24:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他写到他们属于离群索居型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…says they're maladjusted loner types …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.76,0:24:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢把人打晕 拖回去 慢慢享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}like to knock a guy out, drag him home …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.85,0:24:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.48,0:24:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆叮嘱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam told me to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.48,0:24:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他没音讯的话就打电话给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I didn't hear anything back from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.93,0:25:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的耳鸣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ringing in your ears …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.05,0:25:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是毒液造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from the venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.95,0:25:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venom?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.69,0:25:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给你注射了某种迷药\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hit you with some kind of knockout juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.15,0:25:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来挺冷静的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to be handling this pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.60,0:25:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out there looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.49,0:25:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是李·钱伯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee Chambers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.01,0:25:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是鲍比·辛格的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend of Nobby Singer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里希给我打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy called.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 她没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She … she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.36,0:25:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 她只是很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is. She's just worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.87,0:25:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如何逃离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.14,0:25:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be back pretty quick here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.60,0:25:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.65,0:25:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一对儿搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're a tag team.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.11,0:25:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个把你迷昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them knocks you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个把你的卡车 轿车或是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other one dumps your rig or your ride or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.79,0:25:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢在几英里外的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}miles down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.85,0:25:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们这一套玩得很溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pretty nice system they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.52,0:26:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们吸你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been draining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.67,0:26:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.41,0:26:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸个三四次 你就血尽人亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tap you three, four times, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.17,0:26:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.58,0:26:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.29,0:26:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.79,0:26:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为它们当场就会杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they'd kill me right off,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.78,0:26:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们无需这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.19,0:26:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.91,0:26:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们吸了你几次血\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times they fed on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.95,0:26:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,三次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆告诉你他要去哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Sam tell you where he was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.35,0:26:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想弄清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm trying to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.34,0:26:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.98,0:26:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他检查了我爸爸的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…he checked my dad's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.97,0:26:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.92,0:26:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没那个闲工夫安慰你 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I really don't have time to hold your hand here, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.21,0:26:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.50,0:26:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到客厅去等着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying go wait in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.83,0:27:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸也许不是每一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad may not want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.35,0:27:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,都想让你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}every single thing about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.29,0:27:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.76,0:27:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指我爸爸干的活儿的全部信息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean everything about the job my dad was working?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.09,0:27:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆说你不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam said you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆貌似很能干 于是我想 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam seemed competent, so I figured, fine …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.66,0:27:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就按我爸爸一直说的那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do what my dad always tells me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.78,0:27:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「做个普通的孩子 什么都别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Be a regular kid, don't say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.86,0:27:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay out of the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.64,0:27:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大人去操心「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the adults work it out."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.91,0:27:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路算是行不通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.09,0:27:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.36,0:27:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗 我这个星期已经够烦的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I have had a long, long week.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.93,0:28:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我懂了 你是个坚强的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I get it. You're a tough kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我是想把萨姆和你爸爸带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm trying to get Sam and your dad back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.85,0:28:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸离开了 没有回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad left, and he didn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.36,0:28:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆离开了 也没有回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam left, and he didn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.09,0:28:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那些信息给你 你也会离开 不再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you the info, you leave, you don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.90,0:28:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.73,0:28:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.79,0:28:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 才不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no. No. Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.96,0:28:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你也别去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.27,0:28:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在把东西给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.88,0:28:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,给不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.20,0:28:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I burned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.78,0:28:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.79,0:28:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过算你走运 我烧之前都背了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But lucky for you, I memorized it all first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:28:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.13,0:28:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 规矩是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.60,0:29:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个很幽默的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fun guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.16,0:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实真的酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually awesome. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.50,0:29:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我没那种心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.79,0:29:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正考虑着正经事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm neck deep in some serious crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.36,0:29:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是情况紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if this wasn't an emergency,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.89,0:29:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你扔到最近的商场去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would drop your ass off at the nearest mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么正经事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What serious crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,报仇雪恨 行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge crap, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.58,0:29:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.50,0:29:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃块饼干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat a cookie or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.01,0:29:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可有件事讲不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing doesn't make sense, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸是个很棒的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's a pretty great hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.21,0:29:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟也壮得跟辆车似的 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your brother's the size of a car, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.61,0:29:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西到底是怎么抓到他们俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so how'd this thing get 'em both?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗜血鬼通常都是成对猎食的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vetalas usually hunt in pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.16,0:29:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和你爸爸都以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and your dad both assumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.93,0:29:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个嗜血鬼独自猎食\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was one thing hunting solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么会这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd they think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们信息有误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they had the wrong info.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.83,0:29:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说 信息有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, best available.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.55,0:29:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的爸爸多年前猎杀了一个不合群的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our dad took down a loner years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.60,0:30:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆拿着他的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam has his journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.17,0:30:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸一定也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad must've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.12,0:30:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据同样的「事实」做出判断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}going on the same facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.03,0:30:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是怎么知道实际情况的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know different 'cause…?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.72,0:30:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我几年前也猎杀过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I hunted one that turned out to be two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.84,0:30:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来才发现是两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}a couple years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.23,0:30:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却从来都没有告诉萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never told Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.12,0:30:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.30,0:30:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不把你的经验分享出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout sharing that with the rest of the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不会统统送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we don't all get killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.33,0:30:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆当时去斯坦福念大学了 聪明蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam was away at Stanford, smartass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.66,0:30:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆上过大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam went to college?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.07,0:30:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说你们的爸爸是个猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said your dad was a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.33,0:30:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.56,0:30:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.41,0:30:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可萨姆退出 上了大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam quit, went to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.70,0:30:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以 上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could, too, you know … go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.53,0:30:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个猎人兼儿科医师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a hunter/pediatrician.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:30:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日特色菜 猎人 开怀畅饮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunter day at the all-you-can-eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.32,0:31:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家感觉怎么样 还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's everyone feeling? Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.07,0:31:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,闷不吭声啊 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong silent. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.83,0:31:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不用拿我的食物消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need much entertainment with my meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.94,0:31:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莉 我跟你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sally, uh, did I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.28,0:31:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在犹他州猎杀的嗜血鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the Vetalas I took down in Utah?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.49,0:31:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我想起了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.02,0:31:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们要 年轻得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except they were so much…younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.08,0:31:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他们绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tied 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.54,0:31:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒不是非绑不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.65,0:31:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是\N{\fnArial\fs30}More so…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.24,0:31:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could take my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.35,0:31:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在撒谎 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're lying. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.62,0:31:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.41,0:31:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我多喜欢把你的姐妹们大卸八块的感觉 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- how much I enjoyed cutting up your sisters. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.38,0:32:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你爸爸一起干过活儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever actually work with your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.36,0:32:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. 'course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.03,0:32:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是指真正地参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean work,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.81,0:32:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是在树林里射罐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}not shoot cans in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.96,0:32:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都有帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I help all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.87,0:32:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.24,0:32:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肚子现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, right about now,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也差不多该饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your stomach should be pretty knotted up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.25,0:32:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.81,0:32:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 可能你像我这么大的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe this was a lot harder for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.72,0:32:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能像我这么轻松应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.82,0:32:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自认为是个好演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think you're a good actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.26,0:32:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.56,0:32:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.64,0:32:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate to break it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.30,0:32:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你满脸都写着 你很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's all over your face … you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.17,0:32:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再把我当成小女孩看待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit treating me like I'm some girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.19,0:32:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一生都在为此做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been prepping for this my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.10,0:32:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training's one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.91,0:32:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正猎魔是完全不同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing … whole nother beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.20,0:32:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的吓坏我了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You really scared me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.13,0:32:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女服务员为什么会进卡车里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that waitress getting into that truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.97,0:33:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要跟你解释这种限制级的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not explaining the r-rated crap to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.90,0:33:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她坐进前面了 而不是后面 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The front of the truck, not the back, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.27,0:33:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.09,0:33:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都什么年代了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What century is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.89,0:33:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,早都没人再碰拳头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one fist-bumps anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别装了 你干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Give it up. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.53,0:33:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个老土\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.44,0:33:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你搞什么 - 我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell? - I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.51,0:33:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你留在这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout you stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.70,0:33:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm the jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可不会带个孩子去冒险 就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who ain't bringing a kid in there, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.36,0:33:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.23,0:33:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到的我都能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do everything you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他们都救回来的 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring them back. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.89,0:33:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 他们可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, they're probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.92,0:33:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.13,0:33:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been days.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.12,0:33:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只剩一滩肉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just a pile of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.29,0:33:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经历过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.28,0:33:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,人是会死的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}People die, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.02,0:34:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼看着我妈妈被撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched my mom get torn to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.62,0:34:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我一起去 然后杀了她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go in there and kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.02,0:34:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 你真是个伪君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - You're such a hypocrite.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.50,0:34:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么能去而我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you get to do it and I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.19,0:34:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm the grown-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.87,0:34:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.97,0:34:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 你的撬锁工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Your lock pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.00,0:34:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会搜你身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will frisk you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.28,0:34:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.83,0:35:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我们找到个新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing we picked up a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个快要喝干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's about tapped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.07,0:35:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我同时解决他俩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to finish him together?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.85,0:35:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 坚持下 我来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, hold on. I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.91,0:35:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里希 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.40,0:35:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.47,0:35:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就让这个阳光小美女血溅当场\N{\fnArial\fs30}or little miss sunshine here gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.96,0:36:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的啊 把她带到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking bring her here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.51,0:36:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在把刀放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now drop the knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.74,0:36:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.85,0:36:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想今天谁都走不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't think we'll be letting anyone go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.14,0:36:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.67,0:36:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.18,0:36:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 父女温情时刻结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Enough with the family bonding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.17,0:36:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候该让你闭嘴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for you to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.19,0:36:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.89,0:36:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.05,0:36:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.02,0:36:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人帮得了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.63,0:36:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就只能靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll have to help myself, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.01,0:37:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,演得烂 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad actress, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.25,0:37:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 算我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.60,0:37:20.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（急诊室）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.62,0:37:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在想你们什么时候过来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was hoping you'd stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.99,0:37:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想当面道声谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.06,0:37:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.10,0:37:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命 还有克里希的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you saved my life. Krissy's, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.13,0:37:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 她救了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, uh she kind of saved ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.34,0:37:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别谢我们 退出吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank us. Quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿才十四岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter's 14 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.59,0:37:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经成为猎手 而且动手杀了一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's already a hunter with a kill under her belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.12,0:37:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我多管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to be a dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.08,0:37:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你想想她以后的生活会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what do you think that does to her life span?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.92,0:37:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有机会过上正常女孩的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could still be a regular kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:37:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我入这行是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got into this for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.72,0:38:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 是因为你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.92,0:38:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也应该为你现在的家人而退出这行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the same reason you should get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.83,0:38:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识哪个猎人退出这一行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever know anyone who left the life?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.28,0:38:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.83,0:38:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在退出前被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all get killed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.24,0:38:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不打扰了 你再休息会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh… we should probably let you get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.65,0:38:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.70,0:38:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.84,0:38:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来道别 大笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for saying bye, asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.38,0:38:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗 你不会是过来哭哭啼啼告别的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what? Now you're sentimental?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.47,0:38:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.90,0:38:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是过来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.72,0:38:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个老头挺有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're kind of amusing for an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么打开手铐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get out of them cuffs, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩都有自己的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl's got to have her secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.84,0:39:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,发卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.60,0:39:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会送命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you could've gotten yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.12,0:39:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.23,0:39:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的道理没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.06,0:39:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你确实救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.18,0:39:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我想我就不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… guess I'm retiring …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.52,0:39:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}one and done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.82,0:39:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 你有什么感受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? How you feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.45,0:39:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.86,0:39:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我会想萨姆一样 去斯坦福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll go to Stanford like Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.68,0:39:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们真逊 - 对 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're so lame. - Yeah, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.20,0:39:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.26,0:39:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样对他们也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.22,0:39:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.80,0:39:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你知道你的朋友已经没事时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to walk away from someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.24,0:39:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,再离开 感觉真的很放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and feel like they could be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样 你没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you? How you doing? You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.64,0:40:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我肯定不是很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.71,0:40:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, I mean, I think, maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.00,0:40:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.13,0:40:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用我问吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I even ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.54,0:40:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.73,0:40:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「没事」的意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fine, " meaning…?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.21,0:40:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 我们应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. We should just…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.70,0:40:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心工作 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.70,0:40:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后想个辙干掉迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And figure out a way to kick Dick Roman's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.45,0:40:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, we are the professionals.
